1
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,600
Someone wants to see you.

2
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,960
Xie Zhengyan.

3
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,240
When did you get out?

4
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,080
Huo Jia, your most beloved,

5
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,920
was killed by these very hands

6
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,200
of mine.

7
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,040
You lunatic!

8
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,520
Get off me!

9
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:40,400
Today was supposed to be my daughter Xie Liluo's engagement day.

10
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,080
I didn't expect to be deceived by you.

11
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,240
Aries,

12
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:51,200
weren't you the one who claimed to love my daughter the most?

13
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:54,160
I was truly mistaken about you.

14
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,920
So you are Du Juan's son.

15
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,040
Yes,

16
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,360
I've been waiting for this day

17
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:07,240
for so long.

18
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,000
Wake up.

19
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,120
It's me, Zizhou.

20
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,040
I'm fine, you go in first.

21
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,600
I can hold them off.

22
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,640
It's okay.

23
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,040
I have a backer,

24
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,800
Kang Qingtian,

25
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:34,120
a tycoon from Guangcheng.

26
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,720
You can't defeat me.

27
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:41,960
He Huan,

28
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,600
you've committed numerous crimes.

29
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,040
We're here to arrest you.

30
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,400
The police have found

31
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,280
the crime scene at the Mirror Room

32
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,360
and Xie Liluo's body.

33
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:57,960
Liluo.

34
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,600
I'm sorry.

35
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,200
I'm sorry.

36
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,600
It's Mom.

37
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,440
My babe.

38
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,760
I'm so sorry.

39
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,200
It's all my fault.

40
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,520
I wasn't trying to kill my daughter,

41
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,760
but that despicable Yan Xiaoxiao,

42
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,160
Huo Jia's daughter!

43
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,560
You lunatic!

44
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:33,680
How could you harm your own daughter!

45
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,200
My daughter Yan Xiaoxiao

46
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,920
fell off the building because of you.

47
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,400
I really regret

48
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,160
for being deceived by you,

49
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,640
causing my wife Huo Jia's death,

50
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,120
and driving my daughter to jump off the building.

51
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,720
You lunatic!

52
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,120
You lunatic!

53
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,640
You're the lunatic!

54
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,000
You're the lunatic!

55
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,320
Let go of me!

56
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,440
Let go of me!

57
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,600
Let go of me!

58
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,280
Let go of me!

59
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,920
I'll take her to the interrogation room.

60
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,720
I'll be there later to complete the statement.

61
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,120
It's me.

62
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,040
It's all my fault.

63
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,520
It's all my fault.

64
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,840
Mingqi,

65
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,800
I'm so sorry.

66
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,240
I owe this to your sister.

67
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,240
Just let me die.

68
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,680
You don't have to die.

69
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:55,080
Look who I brought here.

70
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,960
You are my

71
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,200
biological father?

72
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,000
Xiaoxiao.

73
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:23,000
Xiaoxiao.

74
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,800
Xiaoxiao.

75
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,360
Dad.

76
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,640
You're here to laugh at me?

77
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,040
This is

78
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:29,560
the Xiaoxiao you've been desperate to find.

79
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,680
Now,

80
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,680
anything to say?

81
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,040
I'm destined to die.

82
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,320
This time, I lost.

83
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,840
I willingly accept my punishment.

84
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,560
What do you want to know?

85
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,560
I'm a dying man anyway.

86
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:55,000
There's nothing left in this world for me.

87
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,680
He Zhengnian is dead.

88
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,600
So as Liluo.

89
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,840
Everything I fought for half my life

90
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,280
is all gone now.

91
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,040
It's all your fault.

92
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,360
Do you know how much I sacrificed

93
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:12,120
to get all this?

94
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:15,920
Yan Xiaoxiao,

95
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,480
I've known all along

96
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,720
that you aren't dead.

97
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,680
You were in my daughter's way.

98
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,920
You deserve to die. You should be dead.

99
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,240
You only deserve to be a puppet.

100
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:26,960
He Huan,

101
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,400
everything that happened today

102
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,640
is exactly what you deserve.

103
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,880
Shut up!

104
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,720
You're just a loser.

105
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,080
You have no right to talk to me.

106
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,080
I only resent Yan Zizhou.

107
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,000
You fake Aries.

108
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,680
Sit down!

109
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,920
It was your greed

110
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,880
that killed your daughter

111
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,480
and almost killed me too.

112
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,160
You've harmed so many people.

113
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,040
I didn't attempt suicide.

114
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,440
It was her.

115
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,720
She told Miss Wong

116
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,040
to push me off the building.

117
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,160
To prevent those involved from evading investigation,

118
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,680
detain her.

119
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:23,400
Okay.

120
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,880
The DNA testing of Liluo

121
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,360
and Lily

122
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,800
proves their blood relation match is low.

123
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:48,320
So the possibility that you and Liluo are blood relatives

124
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,640
is only 3 percent.

125
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,760
Meaning there's no blood relation at all.

126
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,600
You're not father and daughter.

127
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,720
Impossible!

128
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,960
Back then, He Huan knelt before me with a pregnancy test report.

129
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,160
That's why I believed her.

130
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,960
I took care of Liluo for 18 years.

131
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,280
I've endured the torment all these years

132
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,240
all for Liluo.

133
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,280
They tortured me beyond recognition

134
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,280
and even made me their puppet.

135
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:21,760
I never expected

136
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,680
the truth would be like this.

137
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:31,560
Now,

138
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,120
what do you want?

139
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,400
You're willing to help us?

140
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,640
I can cooperate with you

141
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,600
and do whatever you want.

142
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,080
But promise me,

143
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,960
you must bring He Huan and her gang

144
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,360
to justice.

145
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,960
We need the original equity mortgage certificate now.

146
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,080
We can help you repay the loan

147
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,320
to reclaim Zhengyan.

148
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,160
Many years ago,

149
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,320
I hid it

150
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,200
in the safe box at Stellarport Bank.

151
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:03,720
I'll issue

152
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,320
an unlocking authorization for you.

153
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,400
Thank you, Second Uncle.

154
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,200
Rest well here.

155
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,240
We hope your legs

156
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,480
recover soon.

157
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,160
Okay.

158
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:20,920
Zizhou,

159
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,240
Xiaoquan.

160
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,240
I'll entrust

161
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:28,120
Zhengyan Group to you.

162
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,760
Lily

163
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:38,600
was captured by Victor that night.

164
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:40,880
Let me go!

165
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,920
Let go of me!

166
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,640
Who are you?

167
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,680
Why are you kidnapping me?

168
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,400
Xiaoxiao's been taken. She's up ahead.

169
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:52,160
Hurry!

170
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,800
Okay.

171
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,160
Xiaoquan.

172
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,280
Lily's been taken to the biochemical factory.

173
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,520
Victor is extremely dangerous.

174
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,400
We have two helicopters

175
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,560
at the harbor helipad.

176
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,680
You take one of them first.

177
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,920
I'll be there soon.

178
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,360
Okay.

179
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,600
Why are you kidnapping me?

180
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:43,360
Because I like the taste of your blood.

181
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:43,560
You're awake.

182
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,280
Why are you so impulsive every time?

183
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:49,920
If I get hurt,

184
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,440
would you be sad?

185
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,400
Of course, I would.

186
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,800
Look at this.

187
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,400
It's a bullet.

188
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:03,560
You almost died, you know?

189
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,960
Even though I'm a doctor,

190
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:15,920
I'm also a human being.

191
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,440
You have no idea

192
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,920
the moment I heard you were shot,

193
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,120
my hands were trembling.

194
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:26,400
Jinning,

195
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,040
every time it's you who saves me.

196
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,040
No matter how many times I say thank you,

197
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:32,280
it's never enough.

198
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,600
I don't want your thanks.

199
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,920
I just want you to live well,

200
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,280
to survive.

201
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,160
I'm an orphan.

202
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,040
In this life,

203
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,040
you're my only friend.

204
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,440
Jinning,

205
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,240
I know you care deeply for me.

206
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:56,960
From now on,

207
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,200
I'll do my best to protect myself.

208
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:02,640
I won't make you

209
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:06,040
or any of the family worry again.

210
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,560
It's bleeding again.
